Purpose
=======

This file defines a low-context reading strategy for Waterloo Docstrings.
It targets a hard budget of <= 20,000 tokens while preserving practical
coverage for most implementation and tooling tasks.

Token Baseline
==============

Measured with `tiktoken` using `o200k_base` (May 7, 2026).

- Full recommended set from `READ_THE_DOC`: ~50,798 tokens
- `source/format.rst` alone: ~22,913 tokens (cannot fit into a <=20k pass)

