When Format Spec Is Required
============================

If the task requires normative details from `source/format.rst`, read it in
three chunks (balanced by token count):

1. `source/format.rst:1` to `source/format.rst:702` (~7,586)
2. `source/format.rst:703` to `source/format.rst:1141` (~7,693)
3. `source/format.rst:1142` to `source/format.rst:1682` (~7,634)

Combined `format.rst` total: ~22,913 tokens.

Usage Guidance
==============

- Start with the <=20k path for quick orientation, lint/tooling work,
  JSON/HTML pipeline tasks, and example-driven implementation.
- Add `format.rst` chunk(s) only if you need strict rule semantics,
  parser/validator edge behavior, or rule-ID level decisions.
- Continue to ignore generated/cache folders as documented in `READ_THE_DOC`.
